        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 118911,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prima di poter iniziare a interrogare una tabella del database, dobbiamo, naturalmente, prima creare la tabella e popolarla.</p><p>Vediamo innanzitutto come creare una tabella <code>Directory</code> con colonne per il numero del <code>floor</code> e la <code>company</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE Directory (&#xA; floor INTEGER,&#xA; company TEXT&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO Directory (floor, company) VALUES (1, &quot;ACME Inc.&quot;);\"><tables><table name=\"Directory\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"ACME Inc.\" /></row></table></tables></database></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Basic Syntax",
            "id": 118912,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La sintassi di base per creare una tabella SQL inizia sempre con le parole chiave <code>CREATE TABLE</code> seguite dal nome della tabella.</p><p>Ora tocca a te creare la tabella <code>Directory</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>CREATE</code>, seguito da <code>TABLE</code> e infine <code>Directory</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La sintassi di base per creare una tabella SQL inizia sempre con le parole chiave <code>CREATE TABLE</code> seguite dal nome della tabella.</p><p>Crea la tabella vuota <code>Directory</code>, invece di modificare o inserire dati in una tabella.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ALTER\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"INSERT\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"DATABASE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Directories\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>CREATE</code>, seguito da <code>TABLE</code> e infine <code>Directory</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Column Definition",
            "id": 118913,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Successivamente, dobbiamo dichiarare quali colonne vogliamo creare. Aggiungiamo il nome di ogni colonna, seguito dal relativo tipo di dati.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>floor</code>, seguito da <code>INTEGER</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dichiara le colonne da creare. Aggiungi il nome di ogni colonna seguito dal relativo tipo di dati.</p><p>Usa <code>INTEGER</code> per i numeri interi e <code>TEXT</code> per il testo.</p><p>Assegna alla colonna del piano un tipo intero, lasciando quella dell'azienda come testo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"level\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TEXT\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"REAL\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Directory\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>floor</code>, seguito da <code>INTEGER</code> e infine <code>company</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Column Definition II",
            "id": 121132,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I tipi di dati validi per le colonne includono <code>INTEGER</code>, <code>REAL</code> (per i numeri in virgola mobile) o <code>TEXT</code>. Puoi anche usare <code>BLOB</code> o <code>NULL</code>, ma non li tratteremo qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>company</code>, seguito da <code>TEXT</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I tipi di dati validi per le colonne includono <code>INTEGER</code>, <code>REAL</code> (per i numeri in virgola mobile) o <code>TEXT</code>. Puoi anche usare <code>BLOB</code> o <code>NULL</code>, ma non li tratteremo qui.</p><p>Memorizza un nome di azienda nella seconda colonna, non un numero o un valore mancante.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"INTEGER\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"REAL\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"NULL\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>floor</code>, seguito da <code>company</code> e infine <code>TEXT</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Inserting Values",
            "id": 120194,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una volta creata la struttura della tabella, non resta che inserire alcuni valori. Abbiamo già trattato questo concetto.</p><p>Possiamo inserire tutti i valori che vogliamo quando vogliamo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Acme Inc.'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Homeflix'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Directory\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Acme Inc.\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Homeflix\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>INSERT</code>, seguito da <code>INTO</code> e infine <code>VALUES</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo aver creato la struttura della tabella, inserisci alcuni valori con la sintassi imparata in precedenza.</p><p>Usa l'istruzione che aggiunge righe per inserire ogni azienda e piano in <code>Directory</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Acme Inc.'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Homeflix'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"FROM\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"WHERE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TABLE\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>INSERT</code>, seguito da <code>INTO</code>, <code>Directory</code> e infine <code>VALUES</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Seeing a created table",
            "id": 120195,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ecco la tabella <code>Directory</code> con i valori aggiunti.</p><p>Nota come sono struttigate le righe e le colonne e che aspetto hanno infine in una tabella.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE Directory (&#xA; floor INTEGER,&#xA; company TEXT&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO Directory (floor, company) VALUES (1, 'Acme Inc.');&#xA;INSERT INTO Directory (floor, company) VALUES (2, 'Homeflix');\"><tables><table name=\"Directory\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Acme Inc.\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Homeflix\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Acme Inc.'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Homeflix'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Column Definition II - Copy",
            "id": 132699,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo aggiungere <code>IF NOT EXISTS</code> per assicurarti che la tabella venga creata solo se non esiste già, evitando errori.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IF\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"NOT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"EXISTS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>IF</code>, seguito da <code>NOT</code> e infine <code>EXISTS</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>IF NOT EXISTS</code> per creare la tabella solo se manca, evitando un errore se esiste già.</p><p>Completa la protezione prima del nome della tabella, in modo che rieseguire questa istruzione non tenti di ricreare <code>Directory</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IF\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"NOT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"EXISTS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"WHERE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"NULL\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"DROP\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Directories\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>IF</code>, seguito da <code>NOT</code>, <code>EXISTS</code> e infine <code>Directory</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Basic Syntax",
            "id": 118978,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con quali parole chiave inizia sempre la sintassi per creare una tabella SQL?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>CREATE</code> seguito da <code>TABLE</code> seguito dal nome della tabella</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>TABLE</code> seguito dal nome della tabella seguito da <code>CREATE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>CREATE</code> seguito da <code>TABLE</code> seguito dal nome della tabella.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un'istruzione sta per creare una tabella chiamata <code>Directory</code>. Quale apertura permette a SQL di creare questa tabella?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>CREATE TABLE Directory</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>TABLE Directory CREATE</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>INSERT INTO Directory</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>CREATE Directory TABLE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>CREATE TABLE Directory</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Column Definition",
            "id": 118979,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali caratteristiche delle colonne deve includere come minimo la sintassi di creazione della tabella?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il nome e il tipo di dati di ogni colonna</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nome di ogni colonna</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il nome e il tipo di dati di ogni colonna.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In <code>CREATE TABLE Directory (...)</code>, la nuova colonna <code>floor</code> deve memorizzare numeri interi. Cosa deve apparire per questa colonna?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il suo nome e un tipo di dati, come <code>floor INTEGER</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo il suo nome, <code>floor</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo il suo tipo di dati, <code>INTEGER</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Un valore da inserire nella colonna</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il suo nome e un tipo di dati, come <code>floor INTEGER</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Column Data Types",
            "id": 118983,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali sono alcuni tipi di dati comuni per le colonne?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>INTEGER</code>, <code>REAL</code> e <code>TEXT</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>BOOLEAN</code>, <code>TRUE</code> e <code>TEXT</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>INTEGER</code>, <code>REAL</code> e <code>TEXT</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>INTEGER</code> per gli interi, <code>REAL</code> per i decimali e <code>TEXT</code> per il testo.</p><p>Definisci il nome di un'azienda, un piano intero e una valutazione decimale, in quest'ordine. Quale sequenza di tipi corrisponde?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">TEXT, INTEGER, REAL</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">INTEGER, TEXT, REAL</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">TEXT, REAL, INTEGER</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">REAL, INTEGER, TEXT</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere TEXT, INTEGER, REAL.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Basic Syntax",
            "id": 118985,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi la sintassi di base per creare una tabella denominata <code>Birthdays</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Birthdays (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" birthday \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>CREATE</code>, seguito da <code>TABLE</code> e infine <code>Birthdays</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una tabella chiamata <code>Birthdays</code>. Dichiara <code>birthday</code> come testo, ad esempio <code>January 3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Birthdays (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" birthday \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"INSERT\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"INTO\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Birthday\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"INTEGER\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>CREATE</code>, seguito da <code>TABLE</code>, <code>Birthdays</code> e infine <code>TEXT</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Column Definition",
            "id": 118986,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la definizione delle colonne per la sintassi di creazione della tabella <code>Birthdays</code>. La tabella deve avere due colonne: <code>name</code> e <code>birthday</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Birthdays (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" birthday \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"46\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>birthday</code>.</p></body></html>"
